This folder contains commands which establish requirements for the world. 

Example:
require PARTICIPANT <name> [source]

Where, [source] can be "world" or "input".
- World means it is expected in the initial world state.
- Input means it is accepte from the environment and created into the world.

Currently, inputs participants will be loaded from the initial arguments, but 
this sets-up the framework for an interactive mode where the user can dynamcially
submit inputs that are used by the behavior.